Modified on 2026-10-21 for the cmdSwitch3 maintenance project:
- Retained original dimming, shell-command options and sequential execution.
- Ported maintained validation, bounded scheduling, polling, action error,
  stale-state, cache-identity and shutdown fixes from the local
  homebridge-cmdswitch2-no-logs 0.5.1-maintenance.1 work.
- Acknowledge normen's settings-schema work and joepool's no-logs/Homebridge 2
  lineage. Quiet logging is now opt-in; the settings UI is newly implemented.
- Added Homebridge 2-only promise handlers, dimmer fixes, tests and documentation.
- Removed Homebridge 1 compatibility and the old configuration wizard/ExecQueue.

